Diagnosis: proposals table has 4 rows, ALL status=applied with reflected_at
null. Propose->apply works (accept path + Review Inbox fine); the reflect
step that distills applied proposals into memories never runs (runReflection
only reachable via POST /api/agent/reflection, no autonomous trigger). That
is why memories=0 and a5ecc5aa is moot. Root unblock = 3ecc1859.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
